# Thong nhat kieu xuong dong, tranh git bao "ca file thay doi" gia.
# Ly do: dashboard web ghi phanbo.json len GitHub bang LF, con Windows
# (core.autocrlf=true) checkout ra CRLF -> git thay khac -> autostash ->
# xung dot khi pull. Chot LF cho du lieu, CRLF cho file .bat cua Windows.
* text=auto

*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf

*.xlsx binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
